    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "043b7d8ce4d3f4ea",
      "translationZh": "文章的技术要点",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dca2175a7d5a85f7",
      "translationZh": "为什么在相同的深层上下文下 ATX 快约 15%：",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa8d4a2b45d670b9",
      "translationZh": "在标准量化中，将推测头（blk.64）压缩到 Q5 会导致约 36% 的提议草稿令牌在拒绝采样中失败，将吞吐量降低到约 45 t/s。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b473e81b8295232",
      "translationZh": "在 ATX-Swift-1.5 中，将 blk.64 隔离在 Q8_0 级别将草稿准确率从约 64% 提高到约 77%+，每轮交付 3.31 到 3.72 个已验证令牌，并将持续生成速度提高到 51.5 t/s 以上（突发峰值超过 63 t/s）。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "59b8db6c9bd8111a",
      "translationZh": "优化执行脚本",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83e785580e211f48",
